Signal Seeker is a standalone project. It is shipped, unchanged, on the shelf of
DigitalRerun (https://github.com/cstroie/digital-rerun), but it is not part of
DigitalRerun, and the licence above, not DigitalRerun's, is the one that covers
this repository and the SIGSEEK.COM and SIGSEEK.DAT built from it.
